{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"p0-title","type":"text","text":"# Phase 0 simulation roadmap\nBuild one auditable basketball simulator in measured steps. Follow the arrows; each completed phase leaves evidence.","x":-650,"y":-750,"width":1400,"height":150,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"p0-a","type":"text","text":"## 0A ✅ ENGINE\nDeterministic resolver\n• legal action contract\n• decision tape + events\n• exact replay","x":-650,"y":-540,"width":420,"height":220,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"p0-b","type":"text","text":"## 0B ✅ CALIBRATION\n1,000 reproducible games\n• team + player metrics\n• realism guardrails\n• rebound bug corrected","x":-180,"y":-540,"width":420,"height":220,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"p0-c","type":"text","text":"## 0C ✅ AI GUARDRAIL\nLegal actions only\n• strict JSON validation\n• deterministic fallback\n• exact recorded replay","x":290,"y":-540,"width":420,"height":220,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"p0-d","type":"text","text":"## 0D + 0D.1 ✅ LEAGUE\nSchedule + standings\n• three saved seasons\n• between-game fatigue\n• 60/60 replay hashes","x":290,"y":-250,"width":420,"height":220,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"p0-half","type":"text","text":"## 0D.2 ▶ ROTATIONS\n**NEXT GATE**\n• player minutes\n• minimal substitutions\n• fatigue from actual workload","x":-180,"y":-250,"width":420,"height":220,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"p0-later","type":"text","text":"## 0.5 ◇ PLAYABLE LOOP\nAfter rotations pass:\n• browse teams + schedule\n• lock predictions\n• server simulation + credits","x":-650,"y":-250,"width":420,"height":220,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"p0-evidence-b","type":"text","text":"## 📊 Calibration evidence\n[[Development/Reports/Phase 0B Baseline|Open Phase 0B report]]\n1,000 games · 9/9 checks passed · rebound concentration corrected","x":-650,"y":50,"width":420,"height":180,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"p0-evidence-c","type":"text","text":"## 🛡️ AI + fairness evidence\n[[Development/Reports/Phase 0C Offline LLM Policy Pilot|Open Phase 0C report]]\n8,140 decisions · paired fairness · exact replay\n[[Design/Decisions/DEC-004 AI Retraining Budget|Retraining limit: $5]]","x":-180,"y":50,"width":420,"height":180,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"p0-evidence-d","type":"text","text":"## 🔐 League + fatigue evidence\n[[Development/Reports/Phase 0D Schedule and Standings|Schedule report]] · [[Development/Reports/Phase 0D1 Multi-Season Fatigue|Fatigue report]]\nThree seasons · 60/60 replay hashes · exact save/resume","x":290,"y":50,"width":420,"height":180,"color":"3"},
